  "body": "<a name=\"release-1-18-15-fixed\"></a>\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n- `pipx pin --skip` accepts case and punctuation variants of injected package names, with or without their suffix ([#2425](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2425)) by @kowellaloo9698-afk and @gaborbernat.\n- `pipx repair` now refuses an environment whose `pipx_metadata.json` a killed install lost or a newer pipx wrote, as `pipx reinstall` and `pipx reinstall-all` do, instead of reporting it healthy ([#2423](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2423)) by @AP24110011695 and @gaborbernat.\n\n### New Contributors\n\n- @AP24110011695 made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2423\n- @kowellaloo9698-afk made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2425\n\n[🐍 PyPI release](https://pypi.org/project/pipx/1.18.15/)\n\n[📜 Full Changelog](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/compare/1.18.14...1.18.15)\n",
